#
# Dotted borders on a page with no text. A shimmed and an unshimmed Linux
# differ from Windows identically here, 99.9983% and a max channel difference
# of 2 either way, so the shim is not what moves them.
wt/external/wpt/css/css-writing-modes/inline-box-orthogonal-child-with-margins*.html
#
# Image resampling. attribute_diff charges all 80000 px to four <IMG> elements
